    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welkin Melody&quot; combines flight shooting and rhythm-based gameplay, introducing bold innovations in its design. Players can enjoy unique gameplay by syncing their actions with the music rhythm while exploring the fun of flight shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also offers a variety of Weapons for players to customize their attack styles. Additionally, the equipment system provides rich development and strategy options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Story\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of two sisters escaping pursuit from their sect to uncover the truth behind a false accusation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Innovative Combat System\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack and release skills based on rhythm cues from the music. The more precise the timing, the stronger the skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/ff71a997f16e1542c468f7f7dbd2db9e.poster.avif?t=1740462871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/ff71a997f16e1542c468f7f7dbd2db9e.webm?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/ff71a997f16e1542c468f7f7dbd2db9e.mp4?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Customizable Weapon System\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.poster.avif?t=1740462871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.webm?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.mp4?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely select secondary Weapons to change their attack methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010MelodyStone Set System\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.poster.avif?t=1740462871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.webm?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.mp4?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports 2-piece and 4-piece set effects, enabling diverse strategic combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welkin Melody&quot; combines flight shooting and rhythm-based gameplay, introducing bold innovations in its design. Players can enjoy unique gameplay by syncing their actions with the music rhythm while exploring the fun of flight shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also offers a variety of Weapons for players to customize their attack styles. Additionally, the equipment system provides rich development and strategy options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Story\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of two sisters escaping pursuit from their sect to uncover the truth behind a false accusation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Innovative Combat System\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack and release skills based on rhythm cues from the music. The more precise the timing, the stronger the skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/ff71a997f16e1542c468f7f7dbd2db9e.poster.avif?t=1740462871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/ff71a997f16e1542c468f7f7dbd2db9e.webm?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/ff71a997f16e1542c468f7f7dbd2db9e.mp4?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Customizable Weapon System\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.poster.avif?t=1740462871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.webm?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.mp4?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely select secondary Weapons to change their attack methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010MelodyStone Set System\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.poster.avif?t=1740462871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.webm?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229940/extras/b14bade729398f0c4b5109ceb3b1d51d.mp4?t=1740462871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports 2-piece and 4-piece set effects, enabling diverse strategic combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
